              "value": "Eat Portal"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(abjuration, occult)\n\nTrigger: A creature teleports or is summoned within 50 feet of the portal eater\n\nRequirements: The portal eater's beak is not grabbing a creature\n\nThe portal eater attempts to eat the portal. It makes a counteract check against the effect (counteract modifier +33, counteract level 9th). If the effect is counteracted, the creature arrives in the portal eater's beak and the portal eater Grabs it."
